    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>When your opponent lets down its guard, you open it up to additional attacks.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Combat_Reflexes\" title=\"Combat Reflexes\">Combat Reflexes</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Opportunistic_Trickery\" title=\"Opportunistic Trickery\">Opportunistic Trickery</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever an opponent provokes an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a> from you, once per turn you can sacrifice the attack to reduce the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> by 5 until the end of the target's next turn.</p>",
